      "lines": [
        "压强，$S$——活塞的面积。设气体膨胀，活塞在力 $\\vec{F}'$ 的方向",
        "上移动一小距离 $\\Delta h=h_2-h_1$。如果位移小，那么可以认为气",
        "体的压强是不变的。气体的功"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A'=F'\\Delta h=pS(h_2-h_1)=p(Sh_2-Sh_1)$。　（2-24）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个功可以用气体体积的变化量来表示。初体积 $V_1$",
        "$=Sh_1$，而末体积 $V_2=Sh_2$。因此，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A'=p(V_2-V_1)=p\\Delta V$，　（2-25）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式中 $\\Delta V=V_2-V_1$——气体体积的变化量。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "膨胀时，气体做正功，因为力的方向和活塞的位移方向一",
        "致。在膨胀过程中，气体把能",
        "量传给了周围的物体。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果气体压缩，气体做功",
        "的公式（2-25）仍然是正确的，",
        "但是现在 $V_2<V_1$，因此，$A'<0$",
        "（图 $32$）。这时气体做负功，气体",
        "从外界物体得到能量。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 32",
      "box": [
        747,
        852,
        498,
        424
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-32"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 32",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "外界物体对气体所做的功 $A$，与气体的功 $A'$ 的区别仅在",
        "于符号：$A=-A'$，因为对气体的作用力 $\\vec{F}$，在方向上与力 $\\vec{F}'$",
        "相反，而位移相同。因此，作用在气体上的外力的功等于："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A=-A'=-p\\Delta V$。　（2-26）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "负号表明：当压缩气体时，$\\Delta V=V_2-V_1<0$，外力的功是",
        "正的（$A>0$）。相反，当气体膨胀时，这个功是负的（$A<0$），因",
        "为 $\\Delta V=V_2-V_1>0$。显然，这是因为：压缩气体时，力的方向",
        "和活塞位移的方向一致，而膨胀时，这两个方向相反。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "表示式（2-25）和（2-26）不仅对气缸中的气体压缩或膨胀"
      ]
    },
